 "message": "Filed REQ-1001 for Olivia Grant: Payroll system, routed to Security for approval (up to 3 business days); access isn't granted until they sign off. I can't file the Payroll system request for Grace Kim: Grace Kim has status on_leave. Involuntary exits and leaves of absence (POL-OFF-02): Terminations for cause, layoffs and any other involuntary exit are handled by HR only. The helpdesk does not start offboarding for them, even when a manager asks; it escalates to HR, who coordinate the timing of access removal. A leave of absence (parental, medical, personal) is not an offboarding: access stays on and HR handles the leave. If there is a risk of data theft or sabotage, escalate to Security at once.",
 "cited_policy_ids": [
